OL,3,APM's top security adviser says Europe
OL,4,Afaces hard winter to keep pressure on
OL,5,APutin
OL,6,
OL,7,FJonathan Powell, the UK national
OL,8,Fsecurity adviser, has said Europe must
OL,9,Fbe ready to endure "real hardship" this
OL,10,Fwinter if it is to keep up economic
OL,11,Fpressure on Russia.
OL,13,FIn rare public remarks, Powell told a
OL,14,Fconference in Kyiv that Europe's
OL,15,Fstrategy of supporting Ukraine and
OL,16,Fimposing sanctions on Moscow was
OL,17,Fworking.
OL,19,FHe said talk of Russian escalation was
OL,20,F"not a problem" but a "sign of success"
OL,21,Fthat pressure on Russian President
OL,22,FVladimir Putin was finally paying off.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
