OL,3,APM's top security adviser says Europe
OL,4,Afaces hard winter to keep pressure on
OL,5,APutin
OL,6,
OL,7,FSo he said now was not the time for
OL,8,FEuropean nations to take their "foot
OL,9,Foff the gas" and ease sanctions even
OL,10,Fthough the continent faces severe
OL,11,Fenergy shortages this winter.
